      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "60EE10A6520972FF",
      "text": "那么，今天星苦了～\\n下次再比试吧。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "1053C8950B6862D0",
      "text": "呵呵呵，这就是\\n天星队真老大的实力！\\r\\n完全胜利的布布！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "7ADCE7A95190B243",
      "text": "生态巨蛋可真不得了。\\n感觉像是室外，但其实是室内。\\r\\n天空之类的究竟是怎么映照出来的呢？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "7ADCE6A95190B090",
      "text": "帕底亚的飞翔出租车\\n是靠怒鹦哥来飞行的。\\c\\n但在我的老家是靠钢铠鸦哦。\\n在生态巨蛋，情况又不一样。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "7ADCE9A95190B5A9",
      "text": "谢谢你\\n经常带我出来呀。\\c\\n之前我一直窝在家里，\\n所以出门有点费劲……但我很开心哦。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "7ADCE8A95190B3F6",
      "text": "你交换给我的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n和我家的布布相处得很好哦。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "7ADCEBA95190B90F",
      "text": "超赞的布布感觉如何？\\c\\n想让它进化时会有很多选择，\\n不想让它进化也没问题。\\r\\n这就是布布的魅力所在呀。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
